---

This distribution embeds the MuseScore Studio engine (GPL-3.0) as a
WebAssembly component, the Qt for WebAssembly runtime, and the
FluidSynth-based audio engine.  Those components remain independent
GPL/LGPL components; their licenses, source-availability notes and
attributions are recorded in NOTICE and in the per-component license
files under engine/sound/.  The exact source revisions and build
instructions used to produce the WASM artifacts are documented in
docs/BUILDING.md.

